WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.900
Just Speak to It for iPhone, in the iOS Simulator with sample text.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.400
Tap the button to start.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:15.000
Words appear as you speak. The Simulator uses fixed text, not a microphone.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.333
Stop, then copy the text into any app.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:22.433
Use Apple’s on-device speech, or a cloud model.

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:27.033
Choose what the Action Button and Shortcuts do with your words.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:30.800
Find out more at justspeaktoit.com.
